---
import profileImage from "@/assets/images/test/nariz.jpg";
import logo from "@/assets/images/logos/logo2.png"

---

<section id="info-section" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#F5E6D8]">
  <div class="info-grid">
    <!-- Left: Portrait Image -->
    <div class="info-image-col">
      <img
        src={profileImage.src}
        alt="Cirugía plástica facial - Perfil"
        class="info-portrait"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Content -->
    <div class="info-content-col">
      <div class="info-content-inner">
        <!-- Header row: Title + Icon -->
        <div class="info-header">
          <div class="info-header-text">
            <span class="info-eyebrow">Cirugía plástica facial</span>
            <h2 class="info-title">
              Creando la versión<br />más hermosa de ti.
            </h2>
          </div>
          <!-- Decorative Icon -->
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src={logo.src} class="w-14 h-14 md:w-16 md:h-16 lg:w-20 lg:h-20"/>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Decorative separator line -->
        <div class="info-separator"></div>

        <!-- Description paragraph -->
        <p class="info-description">
          Tu tratamiento se personalizará para mejorar la armonía natural de tu
          rostro. Déjanos ayudarte a resaltar tus rasgos más bonitos alisando
          arrugas, líneas y pliegues, para lograr un aspecto más vital, dinámico
          y juvenil que resulte completamente natural. Utilizamos la última
          generación de láseres no invasivos y las técnicas quirúrgicas de
          lifting facial más avanzadas y menos invasivas para una cicatrización
          más rápida y resultados más bonitos y naturales.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* ─── Grid Layout ─── */
  .info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    min-height: 500px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .info-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      min-height: 600px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .info-grid {
      min-height: 650px;
    }
  }

  /* ─── Image Column ─── */
  .info-image-col {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 400px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .info-image-col {
      min-height: unset;
    }
  }

  .info-portrait {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 20%;
    display: block;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
    transition: filter 0.6s ease;
  }

  /* ─── Content Column ─── */
  .info-content-col {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .info-content-col {
      padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .info-content-col {
      padding: 4rem 3.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .info-content-col {
      padding: 4rem 5rem;
    }
  }

  .info-content-inner {
    max-width: 520px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* ─── Header (Title + Icon) ─── */
  .info-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .info-header-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .info-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: "Advent Pro", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #7d6a5d;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .info-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
  }

  .info-title {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #513a31;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  /* ─── Decorative Icon ─── */
  .info-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }

  .info-icon:hover {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  /* ─── Separator ─── */
  .info-separator {
    width: 50px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: #7d6a5d;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* ─── Description ─── */
  .info-description {
    font-family: "Advent Pro", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #513a31;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .info-description {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .info-description {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  }

  /* ─── Scroll-triggered animation ─── */
  .info-content-inner {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: infoFadeIn 0.8s ease-out 0.3s forwards;
  }

  @keyframes infoFadeIn {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
